{
  "name": "reduced-rate-withholding-rounding",
  "description": "A translator invoicing at the reduced rate (defaultVatRate \"reduced\", 10%) a client that is a withholding agent, on 2026-03-16. Translation 3 h × €111.11 = €333.33; printed copies (goods) 2 × €12.50 = €25.00; subtotal €358.33. VAT 10% × €358.33 = €35.833, rounded half up once per rate to €35.83. Withholding 15% of the fees only (goods are not fees): 15% × €333.33 = €49.9995, rounded half up to €50.00. Total €358.33 + €35.83 = €394.16; net payable €394.16 − €50.00 = €344.16.",
